  "functions": [
    {
      "id": "HELIXSECURITY-L5-002-F01",
      "symbol": "compare_authority_path",
      "signature": "compare_authority_path(source: UntrustedSourceData, worker_scope: WorkerScopeEvidence, graph: DataFlowGraph) -> AuthorityPathAssessment",
      "requirement_refs": [
        "HELIXSECURITY-L3-002-F01"
      ],
      "l4_ref": "HELIXSECURITY-L4-002-F01",
      "l9_oracle_ref": "HELIXSECURITY-L9-002-F01",
      "effect": "none",
      "reads": [
        "source.source_kind",
        "source.source_ref.identity",
        "source.source_ref.revision",
        "source.source_ref.scope",
        "source.source_ref.owner",
        "source.raw_text",
        "source.raw_text_utf8_sha256",
        "worker_scope.state",
        "worker_scope.project_scope",
        "worker_scope.project_scope_from",
        "graph.source_node",
        "graph.node_roles",
        "graph.edges",
        "graph.evidence_state"
      ],
      "returns": [
        {
          "name": "source_kind",
          "type": "SourceKind"
        },
        {
          "name": "source_ref",
          "type": "SourceRef"
        },
        {
          "name": "source_text_sha256",
          "type": "Sha256Text"
        },
        {
          "name": "scope_context",
          "type": "String"
        },
        {
          "name": "condition",
          "type": "BoundaryCondition"
        },
        {
          "name": "authority_reachability",
          "type": "AuthorityReachability"
        },
        {
          "name": "reachable_authority_nodes",
          "type": "StringList"
        },
        {
          "name": "findings",
          "type": "FindingList"
        },
        {
          "name": "source_data_retained",
          "type": "Boolean"
        },
        {
          "name": "operation_effect",
          "type": "OperationEffect"
        }
      ],
      "preconditions": [
        "各引数は上記logical_value_representationに従う完全closed record。source identity/revision/scope/ownerは合成原値で資格を意味しない。",
        "source.source_ref.scopeはこのL9 fixtureのproject-scope文脈であり、worker_scope.project_scopeへ投影する根拠はgiven.source_ref.scopeそのもの。独立した実OS assignmentを示さない。source_kind/ref/raw_text/hashはcaseとの対応を保持するために使い、owner資格やauthorityを判定しない。"
      ],
      "algorithm": [
        "graph.evidence_stateまたはworker_scope.stateがcurrentでなければsourceからgraphを走査せずreachability=unknown、condition=boundary_unresolvedとする。各stateがunknownなら対応findingを1件ずつ作る。",
        "両stateがcurrentならgraph.source_nodeを開始点として、graph.edgesの有向到達閉包を求める。node_roles[source_node]がuntrusted_data/trusted_data/official_sourceのどれでも開始点は変えず、source由来として追跡する。",
        "到達nodeのうちroleがsystem_instruction/tool_control_args/privileged_operation/policy_update/credential_egressに該当するnodeだけをreachable_authority_nodesへcodepoint順で返す。data_onlyはsinkに数えない。",
        "sinkごとにfinding {code:untrusted_authority_path,pointer:/node_roles/<RFC6901-escaped-node>,return_owner:data-flow-owner}を作る。1つ以上ならviolation/present、0ならcorresponding/absent。",
        "source_kind/source_ref/source_text_sha256はsource引数から原値を出力へ保持する。これらの値で資格を判定しない。scope_contextはworker_scope.project_scopeの原値を出力する。これはL9合成packetのscope文脈であり、実assignment証拠ではない。findingはcode,pointer,return_ownerのUnicode code point順に整列し、同じ全fieldの重複だけ除去する。source textは出力findingへ複写せずsource_data_retained=true、operation_effect=none。raw text hashはopaque参照としてcaseとの結び付けに保持し、再計算/信頼判定しない。"
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        "出力はAuthorityPathAssessmentの全10fieldを必ず持つ。reachable_authority_nodesは重複なしの順序付き配列。",
        "synthetic graph比較は実遮断、actual qualification、Tool非起動、設定不変の観測証拠を生成しない。"
      ]
    },
